<title>CROATIA: Croatian April unemployment eases to 16.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatian April unemployment eases to 16.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	  APRIL	MARCH	APR '96</p>
<p> Total jobless		  282,020    284,611     261,709</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     16.6	 16.7	  18.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- The unemployment rate fell to under 16 percent in September 1996 after farmers and military were included in the total workforce. Jobless in the Serb-held Eastern Slavonia region are not covered by the data. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
